@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Committee Result Received

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Reports
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Show the approved FullEvaluation report and ranking that the
Evaluation Committee returned to the Officer.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/Reports/EvaluationResult/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load the Approved Evaluation CommitteeRound of the tender
  round and its FullEvaluation TenderReport
  (RankingSnapshotJson).

DEPENDENCIES:
CommitteeRounds, CommitteeVotes, TenderReports.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
Required report lifecycle step (spec §4.4, §4.6, §11); no
Trello card covers it — team assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Committee Result Received";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Reports";
    ViewData["Description"] = "The Evaluation Committee’s approved full evaluation, returned to you after 4/4 approval.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Evaluation result</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Tender / round</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Committee round</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Approved on</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Approvals (must be 4/4)</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Recommended offer</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-ranking-snapshot-frozen">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-ranking-snapshot-frozen">Ranking snapshot (frozen)</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Rank</th><th scope="col">Supplier</th><th scope="col">Technical</th><th scope="col">Financial</th><th scope="col">Final</th><th scope="col">Eligible</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No approved evaluation result yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Read-only for the Officer</strong><p>The Officer checks completeness and forwards the report; scores and votes cannot be changed here. Problems go back to the committee through a clarification or a new committee round.</p></aside>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="SubmitToManager">Submit full report to Manager</a></li>
        <li><a asp-area="" asp-controller="Clarifications" asp-action="Index">Clarifications</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
